# Image copies only prebuilt binaries/ + providers.yaml + docker/config.yaml; keep the build
# context minimal. plugins/ is the staged per-arch plugin tree docker.yml assembles alongside
# binaries/. Anything the Dockerfile COPYs MUST be allowlisted here — a missing entry fails the
# build with "<path>: not found" at the COPY's cache-key step (exactly how the 1.5.0 image build
# failed when docker/config.yaml joined the Dockerfile without joining this list).
*
!binaries/
!plugins/
!providers.yaml
!docker/
